# ==========================================================================
# Curated CTF write-ups repo.
# Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING, then re-include exactly what we keep —
# write-ups (.md), task briefs, curated scripts, and repo config.
# Agent scratch, binaries, archives, extracted trees, venvs, captures,
# one-time secrets stay OUT of git (files remain on disk, just not committed).
# ==========================================================================
*

# --- repo config / metadata ---
!.gitignore
!.python-version
!README.md
!MEMES.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

# --- task folders + their write-ups and briefs ---
!task*/
!task*/*_writeup.md
!task*/task.md

# --- curated deliverable scripts (must pass ruff + ty) ---
!task4/solve_task4.py
!task7/exploit_server.py

# --- named (non-numbered) solved task folders: keep write-ups, notes, flags ---
!beeca/
!beeca/*.md
!beeca/FLAG.txt
!botnet/
!botnet/*.md
!botnet/FLAG.txt
!honeyleak/
!honeyleak/*.md
!honeyleak/FLAG.txt
!honeyvault/
!honeyvault/*.md
!honeyvault/FLAG.txt
!slophacking/
!slophacking/*.md
!slophacking/FLAG.txt
!sotek/
!sotek/*.md
!sotek/FLAG.txt
!sotolambda/
!sotolambda/*.md
!sotolambda/FLAG.txt
!sotolet/
!sotolet/*.md
!sotolet/FLAG.txt
